; udaharana: the example — the rule that applies.
; third limb of panchaavayava.
; "we know: momentum-mantra: mass × velocity → momentum"
;
; the mantra IS the udaharana — a general rule declared in the graph.
; the system finds it by matching bound janya to mantra signatures.

(sangati udaharana
  (swarupa pratijnaa)
  (sthita vak-sthalam)
  (kriya pramana)
  (janya hetu)
  (phala upanaya)
  (drishthanta asprishta-drishthanta))
